{"id":"sentimiento","lemma":"sentimiento","pos":"noun","rank":935,"glosses":["feeling"],"ipa":"/sentiˈmjento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sentimientos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-sentimiento.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me cuesta hablar de mis sentimientos.","en":"I have trouble talking about my feelings.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518890","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"slope"},{"g":"to talk"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Tengo sentimientos por ti.","en":"I have feelings for you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459097","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"you","l":"tú"}]},{"text":"Te acompaño en el sentimiento.","en":"You have my sympathy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453776","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to accompany","l":"acompañar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Puede que haya herido sus sentimientos.","en":"I may have hurt his feelings.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333128","words":[null,null,{"g":"beech, beech tree"},{"g":"hurt, injured"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"it may be that"]]},{"text":"El sentimiento es mutuo.","en":"The feeling is mutual.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461542","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"mutual"}]}]}